WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:27.508
Tom and Cat ran back to the Throne Room.

2
00:00:27.509 --> 00:00:32.339
Tom pointed his wand at the frogs.

3
00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:37.609
He mumbled some strange words.

4
00:00:37.610 --> 00:00:41.174
"Huh?" the king shouted.

5
00:00:41.175 --> 00:00:52.933
Poof! The frogs turned back into princes!

6
00:00:52.934 --> 00:00:55.906
"You were right, Cat!" Tom said.

7
00:00:55.907 --> 00:00:58.536
"I said the spell backwards.

8
00:00:58.537 --> 00:01:01.709
And it worked!"

9
00:01:01.710 --> 00:01:05.508
"Ahem." Princess Mary cleared her throat.

10
00:01:05.509 --> 00:01:08.098
Everyone looked at her.

11
00:01:08.099 --> 00:01:11.491
"I watched the princes while they were frogs.

12
00:01:11.492 --> 00:01:13.759
And I learned a lot."

13
00:01:13.760 --> 00:01:17.087
She pointed to the two fierce princes.

14
00:01:17.088 --> 00:01:20.181
"You fight too much!"

15
00:01:20.182 --> 00:01:23.999
She pointed to the prince who ate lots of flies.

16
00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:27.070
"You are too greedy!"

17
00:01:27.071 --> 00:01:30.048
She looked at the prince who was hiding.

18
00:01:30.049 --> 00:01:35.052
"You are too shy!"

19
00:01:35.053 --> 00:01:38.557
Then she pointed to the prince who was glaring.

20
00:01:38.558 --> 00:01:41.432
"You are too angry!"

21
00:01:41.433 --> 00:01:44.676
"Father," Princess Mary said.

22
00:01:44.677 --> 00:01:51.526
"I cannot marry any of these princes."

23
00:01:51.527 --> 00:01:55.111
The king sighed.

24
00:01:55.112 --> 00:01:58.098
"I want you to be happy.

25
00:01:58.099 --> 00:02:10.016
You must wait until you meet the right prince."

26
00:02:10.017 --> 00:02:13.815
"Thank you, Wizard!" Princess Mary said.

27
00:02:13.816 --> 00:02:20.520
She gave Tom a quick kiss.

28
00:02:20.521 --> 00:02:23.245
Dirk scowled.

29
00:02:23.246 --> 00:02:27.829
"Isn't Tom going to the Grim Dungeon?" he asked.

30
00:02:27.830 --> 00:02:31.035
"Of course not," the king said.

31
00:02:31.036 --> 00:02:46.346
"Tom cast a wonderful spell!"

32
00:02:46.347 --> 00:02:49.230
Tom smiled and petted Cat.

33
00:02:49.231 --> 00:02:52.782
Someday Princess Mary would find a prince.

34
00:02:52.783 --> 00:03:02.817
"But not yet," he thought happily.
